Z||000000||Randy Chavis||01-27-2001||11:57 PM||||Well, I guess you can say my son and I are HOOKED. I have 4 Fieros'..2 85 2m6 SE's..a 86 GT v6 auto and a 87 GT v6 5 speed.I have to have work done on the 86 and 85 to make them road ready for my son..just wondering if you guys have any words of wisdom for me...like what to do and look for...I am too old to play anymore I thought, 50, but must be a second wind I am catching with these things..LOVE THEM....<BR>  Let me know what you think..<P>     Thanks Brad and Randy<P>------------------<BR>85 SE V6<BR>85 SE V6<BR>86 GT V6<BR>87 GT V6||||reg||10
Z||000001||stimpy||01-28-2001||12:02 AM||||Welcome to the forum, guys. As far as what to look for, I'd say look for this form to give you the best advice possible on any technical issue related to our cars.  It's hard to know what to start looking for without knowing the condition of yer cars, but as issues arise, post here and also use the search function to give you plenty of viewpoints.||||reg||14
Z||000002||mrfiero||01-28-2001||12:08 AM||||Welcome!   <P>I'm no doctor, but the fact that you own 4 Fieros tells me you have caught "Fiero fever".   Unfortunatly there is no known cure.......I have to tell you that this fever will spread and more Fieros are in your future.  You may want to warn family members and close friends as the fever is contagious.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Again, welcome to the "club".<P><BR>Mike Valentine<BR>Brighton, CO<BR>'88 Formula 281.2 mi.<BR>'88 GT 16K mi.<BR>'88 GT 68K mi.<BR>'88 GT 123K mi.<BR>'84 econo coupe 91K mi.<BR>'88 Formula (parts car)<BR>'88 coupe (parts car)<P><BR>***As you can see, I have the fever too (caught it in April 1990)***||||reg||10
Z||000003||Cheever2||01-28-2001||12:20 AM||||What?  You bought all four at once?  What's the story?<P>Ogre's cave is a good place to start.  You could also do a search on "reliable" or similar words, as we have discussed the most frequent problems in topics with those words in the name.<P>Welcome!  Jump on it, the water's fine.  Just watch out for the shark we call Stimpy.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> j/k<BR>  <P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||6
